i><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Known price-tag</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bad Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Constipation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Diarrhea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Insomnia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Drowsiness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Dry mouth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Wet mouth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2021600/extras/6b451b85108ea55c432f6bbcd76b2c9e.avif?t=1745119998\" /></div>So come play the Demo now would you please now? See you there! Don't kill me! HAhahaha!</p>",
    "short_description": "An adventure RPG with rhythm based combat encounters, zany characters, moral conundrums and platforming elements? Oh sorry I didn't know this was a question. Yes.",
